{"title":"Career Roadmap — Equipment Design Engineer","role":"Equipment Design Engineer","summary":"A Pharmaceutical Equipment Design Engineer designs, develops, specifies, modifies, and improves equipment used in pharmaceutical manufacturing and processing.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Pharmaceutical Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Pharmaceutical Equipment Design Engineer designs, develops, specifies, modifies, and improves equipment used in pharmaceutical manufacturing and processing."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Process engineering"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical manufacturing"},{"text":"Equipment design"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Heat and mass transfer"},{"text":"Materials engineering"},{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"GMP"},{"text":"Validation"},{"text":"CAD/CAE"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical equipment includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mixing vessels"},{"text":"Reactors"},{"text":"Storage tanks"},{"text":"Process skids"},{"text":"Heat exchangers"},{"text":"Filtration systems"},{"text":"Dryers"},{"text":"Granulators"},{"text":"Tablet-processing equipment"},{"text":"CIP/SIP systems"},{"text":"Bioreactors"},{"text":"Purified-water systems"},{"text":"HVAC/cleanroom systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest professional profile combines engineering design capability with pharmaceutical process knowledge and GMP/validation requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech Pharmaceutical Engineering"},{"text":"Engineering + pharma process + CAD"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Junior Design / Project Engineer"},{"text":"Equipment drawings + calculations"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Equipment Design Engin